      "message": "Nit: `parser[\"cache\"]` also includes every `[DEFAULT]` key (`debug`, `log_config_append`, …), because `configparser` merges defaults into each section. The current assertions aren\u0027t affected, but `\"x\" not in cache` checks would silently break if a matching key were ever added to `[DEFAULT]`. `configparser.RawConfigParser(strict\u003dFalse, default_section\u003d\"__unused__\")` keeps the section on its own.",
